# --- environment -----------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# --- benchmark data: 1.5 GB, all four corpora are public and are fetched -----
# by killtest/data.py. Redistributing them here would bloat the repository and
# duplicate archives whose maintainers already version them.
data/

# --- persisted anomaly scores: 5504 .npz files, 234 MB ----------------------
# Deposited on Zenodo instead, where the record carries a citable DOI. See the
# "Data availability" section of README.md.
results/scores/
*.npz

# --- the manuscript and its typesetting chain -------------------------------
# This repository is the code and data artefact, not the paper. The manuscript
# is under review at a subscription journal, where the accepted version may only
# be self-archived after an embargo; keeping the prose out entirely avoids both
# that trap and any ambiguity about whether the MIT licence at the root covers
# text it was never meant to cover. Springer's sn-jnl.cls and the sn-*.bst files
# are theirs to distribute, not ours.
draft.md
abstract_en.txt
md2tex.py
build_paper.sh
build_bib.py
verify_dois.py
latex/
template/

# --- working scratch -------------------------------------------------------
artifacts/tmp/
*.err

# --- internal working documents --------------------------------------------
# Superseded by draft.md and protocol.md. experiment_report.md in particular
# still carries a k-NN tuned-vs-default comparison across unequal series counts
# that protocol.md V2 corrects, so publishing it would put a number in the world
# that the paper itself does not stand behind.
experiment_report.md
peer_review_round1.md
argument_blueprint.md
paper_outline.md
killtest_report.md
stage1_rq_brief.md
abstract_zh_tw.txt

# --- OS --------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini

# --- Zenodo upload staging --------------------------------------------------
artifacts/zenodo/
artifacts/scores_archive.zip

# --- editor/agent local state ----------------------------------------------
.claude/
